Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 18:25:32 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 253/260] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on the slots-full
 card

A title holding a row-number lookalike no longer splits a row: the headline's count (minus pending claims) is the expected row count, and a text that cannot be split into that many rows with details falls back to the plain card. The row detail is the last trailing (elapsed ...) or (next: ...). The body shows only for the slot cap policy on the plain Approve and Reject card, and hides its toggle when no session holds a slot.
